flowchart TD
  research[Research]:::researcher --> rq{analysis}
  rq -->|READY| plan
  rq -->|NOT READY, NEEDS FURTHER REVIEW, failed| cto
  plan[Plan]:::planner --> pq{plan}
  pq -->|planned| admit1
  pq -->|delivered| done
  pq -->|operator, hold| parked
  pq -->|design, failed| cto
  admit1[Admit 1]:::admitter --> a1{admit 1}
  a1 -->|admitted| slice
  a1 -->|revise| plan2
  a1 -->|escalate, failed| cto
  plan2[Plan revision 1]:::planner --> pq2{plan 2}
  pq2 -->|planned| admit2
  pq2 -->|delivered| done
  pq2 -->|operator, hold| parked
  pq2 -->|design, failed| cto
  admit2[Admit 2]:::admitter --> a2{admit 2}
  a2 -->|admitted| slice
  a2 -->|revise, escalate, failed| cto
  slice[Slice]:::slicer --> sq{slice}
  sq -->|sliced| build1
  sq -->|escalate, failed| cto
  subgraph pass1 [Verify 1]
    build1[Slice tasks: hand, merge onto need branch, task rung]:::fanout --> b1{build 1}
    b1 -->|built| audit1[Audit 1]:::auditor
    b1 -->|built| test1[Need rung 1]:::rung-need
    audit1 --> j1{join 1}:::join
    test1 --> j1
    j1 -->|judge| judge1[Judge 1]:::judge
    judge1 --> jq1{judge 1}
    jq1 -->|residual| rc1{raise check 1}:::raisecheck
    rc1 -->|raised| raise1[Requested higher rung 1]:::rung-raised
    j1 -->|raised| raise1
    raise1 --> rr1{rung 1}
  end
  b1 -->|failed| cto
  j1 -->|verified| merge
  j1 -->|block| rework1
  j1 -->|failed| cto
  jq1 -->|block| rework1
  jq1 -->|failed| cto
  rc1 -->|none| merge
  rr1 -->|pass| merge
  rr1 -->|fail| rework1
  rr1 -->|failed| cto
  rework1[Rework 1: findings and failures to rework slices]:::slicer --> rw1{rework slice}
  rw1 -->|sliced| build2
  rw1 -->|escalate, failed| cto
  subgraph pass2 [Verify 2]
    build2[Rework tasks]:::fanout --> b2{build 2}
    b2 -->|built| audit2[Audit 2, prior context]:::auditor
    b2 -->|built| test2[Need rung 2]:::rung-need
    audit2 --> j2{join 2}:::join
    test2 --> j2
    j2 -->|judge| judge2[Judge 2]:::judge
    judge2 --> jq2{judge 2}
    jq2 -->|residual| rc2{raise check 2}:::raisecheck
    rc2 -->|raised| raise2[Requested higher rung 2]:::rung-raised
    j2 -->|raised| raise2
    raise2 --> rr2{rung 2}
  end
  b2 -->|failed| cto
  j2 -->|verified| merge
  j2 -->|block, failed| cto
  jq2 -->|block, failed| cto
  rc2 -->|none| merge
  rr2 -->|pass| merge
  rr2 -->|fail, failed| cto
  merge[Merge to main]:::merge-main --> mq{merge}
  mq -->|merged| done([Done])
  mq -->|conflict| sync1
  mq -->|failed| cto
  sync1[Sync main into need branch]:::merge --> sy1{sync}
  sy1 -->|merged| st1[Need rung after sync]:::rung-need
  sy1 -->|conflict, failed| cto
  st1 --> sr1{rung after sync}
  sr1 -->|pass| merge2[Merge to main 2]:::merge-main
  sr1 -->|fail, failed| cto
  merge2 --> mq2{merge 2}
  mq2 -->|merged| done
  mq2 -->|conflict, failed| cto
  cto[CTO: P0, full history, block-ship]:::cto --> cq{cto}
  cq -->|research| r_research([New run: research]):::restart-research
  cq -->|plan| r_plan([New run: plan]):::restart-plan
  cq -->|slice| r_slice([New run: slice]):::restart-slice
  cq -->|rework| r_rework([New run: rework]):::restart-rework
  cq -->|lock, failed| locked([Locked: operator only]):::lock
  parked([Parked: a newer reply restarts at plan]):::park
